# This repo is developed on Windows (core.autocrlf=true) and deployed to Linux.
# Git normally detects binary files on its own, but these are load-bearing and a
# corrupted one fails quietly rather than loudly -- a mangled QD form template
# just drops the letterhead off a certification document. Pin them explicitly.
*.pdf  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico  binary
*.xlsx binary
*.gz   binary
